{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 23, :comments ["<b>Let her keep it.</b> Leave her be, and let her keep the pledge." "<b>Lest we become a laughingstock.</b> A mockery, that I gave a signet and cord and staff — a pledge over such a trivial matter —" "and \"here I have sent this kid, and you did not find her\" — and this is a sign that she may keep the pledge."], :book :genesis, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 38, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"] ["Piotrkow, 1907-1911" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH990020973480205171/NLI"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:47:24.946114665Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}